                  <SHORT-NAME>DioEcucPartitionRef</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">
                                            &lt;html&gt;
                                            &lt;p&gt;Maps the Dio driver to zero a multiple ECUC partitions to make the modules API available in this partition.&lt;/p&gt;
                                            &lt;p&gt; Tags: atp.Status=draft &lt;/p&gt;
                                            &lt;/html&gt;</L-2>
                  </DESC>
